WEBVTT

00:01.320 --> 00:02.600
Brother-in-law

00:02.680 --> 00:03.360
This is the invitation

00:03.520 --> 00:05.520
The general asked me to bring

00:06.640 --> 00:07.640
The general hasn't returned

00:07.760 --> 00:08.880
To the capital these years

00:08.960 --> 00:09.480
Who to see

00:09.560 --> 00:10.240
Who not to see

00:10.360 --> 00:10.840
Seeing first

00:10.920 --> 00:12.000
Or later

00:12.080 --> 00:13.560
He's afraid people will think too much

00:13.640 --> 00:14.280
So

00:14.360 --> 00:15.560
He's simply holding a banquet

00:15.640 --> 00:16.400
All at once

00:16.480 --> 00:18.440
To see everyone he needs to see

00:18.520 --> 00:20.187
I delivered it home immediately

00:20.640 --> 00:21.440
Brother-in-law

00:21.520 --> 00:22.920
You're definitely the first person

00:23.040 --> 00:25.000
In the entire capital to receive the invitation

00:25.080 --> 00:26.747
You need to prepare well

00:29.400 --> 00:29.960
Forgot

00:30.040 --> 00:31.040
I need to hurry off

00:31.120 --> 00:32.960
Still need to deliver to the next house

00:33.040 --> 00:33.360
Sister

00:33.520 --> 00:33.960
Brother-in-law

00:34.080 --> 00:35.280
No need to see me off

00:35.360 --> 00:36.760
Haven't finished eating yet

00:37.960 --> 00:39.360
Eat on the way

00:50.120 --> 00:51.800
Who's the blind one

00:52.080 --> 00:53.640
Daring to block my way?

00:53.760 --> 00:55.160
Deserves a beating

01:05.960 --> 01:07.320
I wasn't paying attention just now

01:07.480 --> 01:08.880
Again

01:09.120 --> 01:10.520
Look at his temper
